Mark Healey wrote:

> This thread got me thinking.  Has anyone tried taming one of those
> singular demons?  It would be neat to have a pet Demongorgon to deal
> with WoY, especially since I've never been able to survive him
> (Demongorgon that is).

I recently went digging in the source for this very question.  Sadly, most 
of the unique monsters can't be tamed because they "covet" some of the 
invocation items and/or the amulet.

Juiblex, Yeenoghu, Orcus, Geryon, Dispater, Baalzebub, Asmodeus, and 
Demogorgon can't be tamed, though they can be made peaceful.  The Wizard, 
Medusa, and your quest nemesis can't even be made peaceful.  Humans can't 
be tamed either, so no Oracle, Croesus or quest leader.

If my reading is correct, Pestilence and Famine are the only unique 
monsters that can be tamed.  Sorry.

